    "properties": {
        "documentation_en_gb": "Booking flight tickets - variant process\nIn a travel booking scenario, a traveler submits a flight request to a travel consultant after completing trip planning. The consultant contacts multiple airlines and sends quote requests for the desired route.\n\nThe consultant waits up to 3 minutes for airline responses. After receiving offers, the consultant compares prices and selects the best option. The consultant then requests ticket reservation from the chosen airline. Upon receiving confirmation, the consultant creates an itinerary for the traveler and sends it. The traveler gets electronic tickets from the airline directly.\n\nNote: Airline internal workflows are not shown.",
        "language": "English",
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "meta-vertraulichkeit_en_gb": "Nur für den internen Gebrauch",
        "meta-modelingstatus": "Draft"
    },
